#statement("Proposition")[
$quad$ #emph[\(1)] Let $V = bb(Q) Delta$, then $frak(h)^(*) = V times.o_(bb(Q)) k$ \ #emph[\(2)] For any $h\,k in frak(h)$, $K\(h\,k\)= T r\(a d\(h\)a d\(k\)\)= sum_(alpha in Delta) alpha\(h\)alpha\(k\)$ \ #emph[\(3)] The dual of Killing form restricted on $V$ is rational and positive definite

